    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i used to think i was special. like, i actually thought i was one of those people who would change things. but i hit a wall. i'm just... good. i'm just another guy who's decent at math but never actually brilliant. it feels like i've been living a lie, and now that the ceiling is visible, everything feels kind of pointless.",
